  "generated_model": "##### Sets and Parameters\n\n- Let $T = \\{1, 2, \\ldots, 40\\}$ be the set of tasks.\n- Let $P = \\{1, 2, 3\\}$ be the set of CPUs.\n- Let $f_p$ be the frequency (in GHz) of CPU $p$:\n  - $f_1 = 1.33$\n  - $f_2 = 2$\n  - $f_3 = 2.66$\n- Let $b_t$ be the number of billions of instructions (BI) required by task $t$:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\nb_1 &= 1.1 \\\\\nb_2 &= 2.1 \\\\\nb_3 &= 3 \\\\\nb_4 &= 1 \\\\\nb_5 &= 0.7 \\\\\nb_6 &= 5 \\\\\nb_7 &= 3 \\\\\nb_8 &= 3.5 \\\\\nb_9 &= 4.4 \\\\\nb_{10} &= 3.8 \\\\\nb_{11} &= 3.5 \\\\\nb_{12} &= 2.8 \\\\\nb_{13} &= 4.1 \\\\\nb_{14} &= 2.9 \\\\\nb_{15} &= 5.4 \\\\\nb_{16} &= 5.8 \\\\\nb_{17} &= 2.6 \\\\\nb_{18} &= 4.9 \\\\\nb_{19} &= 3.4 \\\\\nb_{20} &= 3.6 \\\\\nb_{21} &= 5.6 \\\\\nb_{22} &= 0.9 \\\\\nb_{23} &= 1 \\\\\nb_{24} &= 0.6 \\\\\nb_{25} &= 5.1 \\\\\nb_{26} &= 4.8 \\\\\nb_{27} &= 5.3 \\\\\nb_{28} &= 5.9 \\\\\nb_{29} &= 4.9 \\\\\nb_{30} &= 3 \\\\\nb_{31} &= 4.8 \\\\\nb_{32} &= 1.2 \\\\\nb_{33} &= 4 \\\\\nb_{34} &= 1.3 \\\\\nb_{35} &= 5.7 \\\\\nb_{36} &= 3.4 \\\\\nb_{37} &= 2.8 \\\\\nb_{38} &= 2 \\\\\nb_{39} &= 4.8 \\\\\nb_{40} &= 3 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n- The processing time of task $t$ on CPU $p$ is $p_{tp} = \\dfrac{b_t}{f_p}$.\n\n##### Decision Variables\n\n- $x_{tp} \\in \\{0,1\\}$: $x_{tp} = 1$ if task $t$ is assigned to CPU $p$, $0$ otherwise.\n- $C_{\\max} \\geq 0$: The makespan (completion time of the last task).\n\n##### Objective Function\n\n\\[\n\\min C_{\\max}\n\\]\n\n##### Constraints\n\n1. **Each task is assigned to exactly one CPU:**\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{p \\in P} x_{tp} = 1 \\quad \\forall t \\in T\n\\]\n\n2. **Makespan bounds the total processing time on each CPU:**\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{t \\in T} p_{tp} x_{tp} \\leq C_{\\max} \\quad \\forall p \\in P\n\\]\n\n3. **Variable domains:**\n\n\\[\nx_{tp} \\in \\{0,1\\} \\quad \\forall t \\in T,\\, p \\in P\n\\]\n\\[\nC_{\\max} \\geq 0\n\\]\n\n##### Retrieved Information\n\n{\n  \"tasks\": {\n    \"1\": 1.1, \"2\": 2.1, \"3\": 3, \"4\": 1, \"5\": 0.7, \"6\": 5, \"7\": 3, \"8\": 3.5, \"9\": 4.4, \"10\": 3.8, \"11\": 3.5, \"12\": 2.8, \"13\": 4.1, \"14\": 2.9, \"15\": 5.4, \"16\": 5.8, \"17\": 2.6, \"18\": 4.9, \"19\": 3.4, \"20\": 3.6, \"21\": 5.6, \"22\": 0.9, \"23\": 1, \"24\": 0.6, \"25\": 5.1, \"26\": 4.8, \"27\": 5.3, \"28\": 5.9, \"29\": 4.9, \"30\": 3, \"31\": 4.8, \"32\": 1.2, \"33\": 4, \"34\": 1.3, \"35\": 5.7, \"36\": 3.4, \"37\": 2.8, \"38\": 2, \"39\": 4.8, \"40\": 3\n  },\n  \"cpus\": {\n    \"1\": 1.33,\n    \"2\": 2,\n    \"3\": 2.66\n  }\n}",
